---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ja">
  <head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" /><title>404 — LoRAIro</title></head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>404 — LoRAIro</h1>
      <p>ページが見つかりません。利用ガイドから選び直してください。</p>
      <p lang="en">Page not found. Open the user guide in your language.</p>
      <nav aria-label="Language">
        <a href={`${base}/ja/`}>日本語</a>
        <a href={`${base}/en/`} lang="en">English</a>
        <a href={`${base}/zh-tw/`} lang="zh-TW">繁體中文</a>
        <a href={`${base}/zh-cn/`} lang="zh-CN">简体中文</a>
      </nav>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
<style>
  body { font: 1rem/1.7 system-ui, sans-serif; color: #172554; background: #fff; padding: 2rem; }
  main { max-width: 45rem; margin: 4rem auto; }
  nav { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  a { color: #1d4ed8; }
</style>
